      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the end of the episode, Ra Joon-mo texts Tak Ye-jin an apology, and Ye-jin immediately tosses aside her brother's advice about playing hard to get. Minutes after she gets home, the doorbell rings—and a tipsy Baek Seung-chan stands outside Joon-mo's flat holding her ten pancakes.",
